            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>Fixed "Move to Homebrew" still blocking Brave (and similar Chromium-based apps) when Homebrew has a newer patch release than the one installed: the browser-engine number at the start of the installed version (e.g. the 156 in 156.1.98.60) is no longer mistaken for a newer app version. Brave can be moved again, and now shows the pending update</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
